een employed by the employer for at least 12 months.\"],\"scope_text\":\"In determining whether an employee has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, provided that employment periods prior to a break in service of seven years or more need not be counted subject to the exceptions in paragraph (b)(2).\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":592,\"summary\":\"The 12 months an employee must have been employed by the employer need not be consecutive months, provided that the breaks-in-service rules set forth in paragraph (b) apply.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
